{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06598","headline":"登商丘 · 储光羲","name":"登商丘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河水日夜流，客心多殷忧。\n维梢历宋国，结缆登商丘。\n汉皇封子弟，周室命诸侯。\n摇摇世祀怨，伤古复兼秋。\n鸣鸿念极浦，征旅慕前俦。\n太息梁王苑，时非牧马游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}